      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "In an unusual paradox, asthmatics who are chronically treated with bronchodilating beta-agonists sometimes experience a worsening of their condition. A new study describes one possible mechanism and reveals a potential new therapeutic target in the treatment of asthma."},
